Colon fence metadata slots must be a space too

```
::: note	"Title"
x
:::
.
<p>::: note	“Title”
x
:::</p>
```

```
::: note 	"Title"
x
:::
.
<p>::: note 	“Title”
x
:::</p>
```

```
::: note "Title"	[First]
x
:::
.
<p>::: note “Title”	[First]
x
:::</p>
```

```
::: note "Title" 	[First]
x
:::
.
<p>::: note “Title” 	[First]
x
:::</p>
```

```
::: note "Title" [First]
x
:::
.
<aside class="admonition note">
  <p class="admonition-title">Title</p>
  <p class="div-label">First</p>
  <p>x</p>
</aside>
```
